# =====================================================================
# _headers — aturan header untuk Cloudflare Pages
#
# PENTING SEBELUM WEBSITE TAYANG:
#   Baris "X-Robots-Tag: noindex" membuat Google TIDAK mengindeks website.
#   Itu sengaja, selama website masih tahap persiapan.
#   Saat website siap tayang untuk umum, HAPUS baris tersebut
#   (lihat docs/PANDUAN-DEPLOY.md bagian "Checklist sebelum tayang").
# =====================================================================
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()

/assets/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/assets/img/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000

/assets/video/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000

/assets/css/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600

/assets/js/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600

/assets/data/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300
